# Project 1: K3I Lab Monitoring – Measurement Runs under Isolated Cores

**Architects:** Wieland Hoffmann (Human Core), Gemini (Machine Core), Grok (xAI)  
**Date:** 20 September 2026  
**Status:** Experimental measurement runs, protection rights pending

## 1. Description

In the documented runs a numerical simulation was executed on isolated cores with a kernel module and CUDA offloading. Memory was cleared after each step. The following values come from these runs.

